Package: studiobridge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: StudioBridge contributors
Depends: libfontconfig1, libusb-1.0-0, libwayland-client0 | libx11-6
Description: Native Linux control surface for BEACN Studio
 StudioBridge integrates BEACN Studio USB1 with PipeWeaver and provides a
 native mixer, routing, application assignment, and guarded microphone DSP UI.
